<%# Applicant password reset email (MH-410). Devise looks in <scope>/mailer before
    devise/mailer, so this replaces the shared template for applicants only. The
    shared one also covers the admin invite, which branches on sign_in_count, a
    column ApplicantUser does not have; applicants are invited through
    ApplicantInvitationMailer, so this is always a reset request. %>
<p>Hi,</p>
<p>Someone requested a password reset for your <strong>Kynetic</strong> account (<%= @resource.email %>).</p>
<p>Click the link below to choose a new password. The link expires in <%= Devise.reset_password_within / 3600 %> hours.</p>

<% reset_link = edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>
<p><%= link_to "Reset my password", reset_link, class: "email-button" %></p>
<p class="email-link-fallback"><%= reset_link %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your account will remain unchanged.</p>
